<BaseLayout title='Expertise | Trouvus' description='AI strategy, business-model innovation, implementation design, workforce transformation and AI venture advisory.'>
<section class="page-hero"><canvas class="hero-canvas" data-variant="pipeline"></canvas><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Expertise</div><h1>Build the capabilities that make AI valuable.</h1><p class="lead">Our practices follow the actual transformation journey: deciding where AI matters, redesigning how value is created, implementing credible pilots and building the organization’s capacity to scale.</p></div></section><section><div class="wrap"><div id="strategy" class="service-row"><div><img class="icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/icon-strategy.svg" alt=""><div class="eyebrow">Practice 01</div><h2>AI Strategy and Transformation Roadmaps</h2></div><div><p class="lead">For leaders who need to determine where AI should be deployed, what should happen first and how investment should be governed.</p><h3>Typical mandates</h3><p>AI readiness assessment · Executive opportunity workshops · Use-case discovery and prioritization · Transformation portfolio design · Business-case development · AI operating-model design · Governance and risk architecture.</p><h3>Core deliverables</h3><p>Readiness diagnostic · Prioritized opportunity portfolio · Executive decision map · Transformation roadmap · Governance blueprint · Investment and sequencing model.</p></div></div>
<div id="business-model" class="service-row"><div><img class="icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/icon-bizmodel.svg" alt=""><div class="eyebrow">Practice 02</div><h2>Business-Model and Operating-Model Innovation</h2></div><div><p class="lead">For organizations that need to move beyond process automation and reconsider how AI changes value creation, delivery and capture.</p><h3>Typical mandates</h3><p>AI-enabled business-model redesign · Customer-value proposition redesign · Operating-model analysis · Process and decision redesign · Capability mapping · Product and service innovation · Ecosystem strategy.</p><h3>Core deliverables</h3><p>Human-Augmented Business Model Canvas · Value-creation map · Process and decision architecture · Capability-gap analysis · Operating-model blueprint · Innovation portfolio.</p></div></div>
<div id="implementation" class="service-row"><div><img class="icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/icon-implementation.svg" alt=""><div class="eyebrow">Practice 03</div><h2>AI Implementation and Pilot Design</h2></div><div><p class="lead">For organizations ready to turn a strategic priority into a bounded, governable and measurable deployment.</p><h3>Typical mandates</h3><p>Pilot definition · Solution architecture · Vendor evaluation · Generative-AI workflow design · Intelligent automation · Decision-support systems · Analytics · Implementation governance.</p><h3>Core deliverables</h3><p>Pilot Passport · Functional requirements · Technology architecture · Data-readiness assessment · Implementation plan · KPI framework · Pilot evaluation report.</p></div></div>
<div id="workforce" class="service-row"><div><img class="icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/icon-workforce.svg" alt=""><div class="eyebrow">Practice 04</div><h2>Workforce Transformation and Executive Capability</h2></div><div><p class="lead">For leaders who understand that adoption, judgment and capability are as consequential as the technology itself.</p><h3>Typical mandates</h3><p>Executive AI education · Leadership alignment · Workforce capability assessment · Role and workflow redesign · Change strategy · Responsible AI training · Custom academies.</p><h3>Core deliverables</h3><p>Capability maturity map · Leadership program · Role-transition plans · Learning architecture · Adoption scorecard · Change and communication plan.</p></div></div>
<div id="venture" class="service-row"><div><img class="icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/icon-venture.svg" alt=""><div class="eyebrow">Practice 05</div><h2>AI Venture and Innovation Advisory</h2></div><div><p class="lead">For founders and innovation teams developing AI-enabled products, services and business models.</p><h3>Typical mandates</h3><p>AI-native business-model design · Venture positioning · Product strategy · Market validation · Monetization design · Investor narrative · Growth planning.</p><h3>Core deliverables</h3><p>Venture thesis · Business-model architecture · Product roadmap · Market-entry strategy · Investor narrative · Growth milestones.</p></div></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
